sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor V as Visitor
    participant R as Renderer<br/>(inquiry widget)
    participant E as A2UI binding<br/>/api/agent-nexus/a2ui
    participant A as Agent<br/>(model or built-in generator)
    V->>R: describes a need in one sentence
    R->>E: POST /surfaces {intent, version v0.9.1, capabilities}
    E->>A: request + basic catalogue
    A-->>E: components + data model
    E->>E: sanitise against the basic catalogue
    E-->>R: createSurface, updateComponents, updateDataModel
    R->>R: draw the form, bind inputs, run checks
    V->>R: fills in the form, sends it
    R->>E: POST /actions {action, metadata.a2uiClientDataModel}
    E->>E: store action and data model on the surface
    E-->>R: updateComponents + updateDataModel (confirmation)
    V->>R: Start over (instead)
    R->>E: POST /actions {action "discard"}
    E-->>R: deleteSurface
